  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Cut the tops off the tomatoes and scoop out the insides.",
    "In a pan, sauté the onion, ginger, cumin, coriander, and chili powder until the onion is translucent.",
    "Stuff each tomato with the samosa pastry, leaving a small border around the edges.",
